[00:02.24] Roses are red, my love ... doo doo da doooo ...
[00:09.92] a long, long time ago
[00:14.95] on graduation day
[00:19.78] you handed me your book
[00:24.51] i signed this way:
[00:26.08] "roses are red, my love.
[00:31.68] violets are blue.
[00:35.65] sugar is sweet, my love.
[00:38.95] but not as sweet as you."
[00:44.49] we dated through high school.
[00:49.45] and when the big day came,
[00:54.21] i wrote into your book,
[00:58.49] next to my name:
[01:00.75] "roses are red, my love.
[01:05.73] violets are blue.
[01:10.33] sugar is sweet, my love.
[01:13.85] but not as sweet as you."
[01:21.28] then i went far away
[01:25.44] and you found someone new
